      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "VP of Marketing, economic buyer, full-stack B2B marketing leader",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick Fisher is the VP of Marketing at Zafran Security, an economic buyer responsible for marketing strategy.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-038", "zaf-039"]
            },
            {
              "text": "He describes himself as a 'Full-stack B2B marketing leader / storyteller with experience building teams for early stage growth and post-IPO scale.'",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-044"]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Reference his background as a full-stack marketing leader and his experience scaling teams from early stage to post-IPO.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 2
        },
        {
          "h2": "Building ABM program from scratch – hiring a Senior Manager now",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran's ABM program is 'being built from scratch' and they are actively hiring a Senior Manager of ABM & Integrated Campaigns, reporting to the Head of Growth Marketing.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-090"]
            },
            {
              "text": "This indicates a greenfield ABM opportunity where Clue can provide foundational support.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Mention that you saw their ABM hire and offer to help accelerate their program.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Published 'Why I joined Zafran Security' – a thought leader in cybersecurity marketing",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick published a LinkedIn article 'Why I joined Zafran Security' and recently shared that in a proof of value, '96% of vulnerabilities didn’t require patching and can be mitigated using existing controls.'",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-158", "zaf-159"]
            },
            {
              "text": "This shows his narrative focus on risk reduction and data-driven marketing.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Reference his article and his data point about 96% of vulnerabilities not needing patching as a conversation starter.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "problem_now",
      "empty": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "ABM program is being built from scratch – no existing ABM infrastructure",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran's ABM program is 'being built from scratch' and they are hiring a Senior Manager ABM & Integrated Campaigns.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-090"]
            },
            {
              "text": "This means they lack established ABM processes and tools, which is a gap Clue can fill.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Offer to help them accelerate their ABM build with Clue's platform.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Missing dedicated ABM platform – not using 6sense, Demandbase, or Terminus",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran's GTM tooling stack includes Salesforce, HubSpot, and Outreach, but they are explicitly not using any of the major ABM platforms like 6sense, Demandbase, or Terminus.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-089"]
            },
            {
              "text": "This is a gap for a company building an ABM program.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Point out that they are building ABM without a dedicated ABM platform and suggest Clue as a solution.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "27 open roles, including 3 marketing positions – scaling pressure",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran has 27 open requisitions, with 3 in marketing.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-088"]
            },
            {
              "text": "The longest open marketing req is 77 days, indicating difficulty in hiring.",
              "claimIds": []
            },
            {
              "text": "This scaling pressure means they need to be efficient with existing resources.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Mention that you understand the challenge of scaling marketing with open roles and offer Clue to help their team do more with less.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Rapid scaling across all departments – operational pain",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran is experiencing rapid growth, with hiring spanning engineering, sales, customer success, and core infrastructure.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-129"]
            },
            {
              "text": "The CEO said 'The development in AI is very fast, and we need more people.'",
              "claimIds": []
            },
            {
              "text": "This operational strain makes automation and efficiency critical.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Relate to their scaling pains and position Clue as a way to automate ABM workflows.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "openers",
