          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick runs the Cocktail Chemistry YouTube channel (since 2014) and has a book.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-110"]
            },
            {
              "text": "He describes it as 'a side hobby for me and uh one that is quite expensive and time consuming.'",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-100"]
            },
            {
              "text": "Use once, first line only.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: I'm a big fan of your Cocktail Chemistry channel – your Moscow Mule recipe with homemade ginger syrup changed my home bar game.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "96% of vulnerabilities didn't require patching – a data point he shared",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "In a LinkedIn post, Nick revealed that in a proof of value, '96% of vulnerabilities didn’t require patching and can be mitigated using existing controls.'",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-159"]
            },
            {
              "text": "This is a powerful insight for a marketing conversation.",
              "claimIds": []
