          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Wrote 'Why I joined Zafran Security' – his personal mission",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick published a LinkedIn article explaining his rationale for joining Zafran, showcasing his thought leadership on vulnerability management.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-158"]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: I read your article 'Why I joined Zafran Security' – your vision for clarifying risk exposure is compelling.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Informal, community-oriented communicator",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick's communication style is informal and community-focused; he values craft and consistency, as seen in his Patreon ask for regular content.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-161"]
            },
            {
              "text": "This suggests a preference for genuine, non-salesy outreach.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: I appreciate your approach to building a community around cocktail making – it's refreshing to see that same authenticity in security marketing.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "angles",
      "empty": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "Direct mail: Send a cocktail-making kit",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick's hobby is cocktail making, and he invests in top quality liquors and equipment.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-110", "zaf-101"]
            },
            {
              "text": "A direct mail piece with a premium cocktail ingredient or a custom cocktail recipe booklet could grab his attention and show we've done our research.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In the direct-mail brief: Create a personalized cocktail kit with a note referencing his Cocktail Chemistry channel and a custom recipe inspired by his style.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Landing page: Lead with his 96% stat",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick shared that 96% of vulnerabilities didn't require patching.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-159"]
            },
            {
              "text": "A landing page that starts with this statistic, and then positions Clue as the ABM platform that helps him tell that story at scale, would resonate.",
              "claimIds": []
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "On the landing page: Headline: '96% of vulnerabilities don't need patching. But your ABM program might.' Then explain how Clue helps him reach the right accounts with that message.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Content: Co-create a piece on 'Building ABM in a hyped security startup'",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick wrote a thoughtful article about joining Zafran.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-158"]
            },
            {
              "text": "We could propose a joint blog or video series on how ABM can be built from scratch in a fast-growing security company, leveraging his experience and Clue's platform.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-090"]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "Brief the design agent with: Propose a co-branded content series with Nick Fisher on 'Building ABM from scratch in cybersecurity' – use his article as a starting point.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Event: Host a cocktail-making workshop for NYC security marketers",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick is based in New York, and Zafran's office is there.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-042"]
            },
            {
              "text": "An exclusive cocktail-making workshop (leveraging his hobby) for security marketing leaders could be a unique networking event that also showcases Clue's capabilities.",
              "claimIds": ["zaf-110", "zaf-092"]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "For the event: Plan a 'Cocktail Chemistry' workshop for NYC security marketers, co-hosted with Nick Fisher, to discuss ABM and vulnerability management in a relaxed setting.",
          "contactRefs": [{"name": "Nick Fisher"}],
          "priority": 2
        }
      ]
    },
